<!--                  ====================================
                       LS-DYNA Material Cards                       
                      ====================================
                      The enum value is assigned based on : 
                        1.) older numeric scheme of LS-DYNA material names (MAT_001, MAT002 etc.)
                            - Multiply the numeric value by 100 for the same.
                            e.g MAT_ELASTIC (MAT_001) is set to 100
                        2.) "OPTION" keyword availability for the material types
                            - If additonal options are present, then add the options by incrementing
                            by 1 for each possible value
                            e.g LOG_INTERPOLATION option on MatPiecewiseLinearPlasticity is set to 2401 (2400 +1)
 -->
